  "prefLabel": "Ncr 563.04 Rule Violation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 563.04 Rule Violation. The local forest fire warden or the forest ranger or both shall bring to the attention of the selectmen, mayors of cities, or town and city managers any violation of these rules so that expeditious corrective action shall be affected.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5603.04), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
